OL,3,AUK announces sanctions on Israeli
OL,4,Asettlements in West Bank and accuses
OL,5,Asettlers of 'ethnic cleansing'
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe also says France and Canada will
OL,8,Fjoin the UK in imposing sanctions on
OL,9,FIsraeli settlements in the West Bank,
OL,10,Fwhich are illegal under international
OL,11,Flaw
OL,13,FThe move comes as Israel plans to
OL,14,Fdevelop 1,200 new homes in the occupied
OL,15,Fterritory and as settler attacks on
OL,16,FPalestinians have increased this year
OL,18,FEarlier, Israeli and US officials
OL,19,Fwarned the UK over the plans - Israel's
OL,20,FPresident Isaac Herzog called them a
OL,21,F"grave miscalculation"
